#: templates/admin/docs.php:97
msgid "UserFerry exports the people registered on your site — including the custom profile fields that other plugins add — to CSV, Excel, JSON or XML. You decide exactly which users are included and which fields become columns."
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/docs.php:98
msgid "After activation you will find <strong>UserFerry</strong> in the WordPress admin menu. It has seven screens, listed in the sidebar on the left of every plugin page:"
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/docs.php:102
msgid "Site totals, one-click template exports and your most recent files."
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/docs.php:104
msgid "A four-step wizard: users, fields, format, review."
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/docs.php:106
