#: templates/admin/docs.php:223
msgid "Reporting systems that require XML"
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/docs.php:223
msgid "A <code>&lt;users&gt;</code> root with one <code>&lt;user&gt;</code> element per person."
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/docs.php:232
msgid "Each export is listed with its file name, size, format, number of users and columns, the template used and who ran it. <strong>Download</strong> fetches the file again. Administrators can delete single entries or everything at once."
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/docs.php:233
msgid "Files are removed automatically after the number of days set in Settings (30 by default). Set it to 0 to keep them forever."
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/docs.php:240
msgid "Default format / file name"
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/docs.php:241
